WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:05.530
Lately, lots of people have been illegally downloading TV shows over the internet.

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:13.280
Without the rights owner's permission, distribution via bootlegs is illegal!

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.540
Please remember that!

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.200
There are only E and F levels...

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.370
Where could you be?

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:05.750
If you come out now, you can get cute sister Plug's gentle treatment...

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:10.050
Depression level C! Lock on!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:28.530
Now, off to work!

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:18.160
Now!

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:21.200
Fight! In one strike!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.960
Charge!

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.590
I never thought I'd get so lucky in a place like this.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:40.270
No!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.400
Well, let's work hard after drinking this.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.410
This is not Earth...

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.370
...but rather, some parallel world.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.420
In this world known as Life Core...

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:09.630
...there exists an enormous corporation called Neodym.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:14.970
They managed to create a means to travel between this reality and the reality of Earth.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.180
The people of Earth knew nothing...

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:20.430
...and the people of this reality found a new job.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:22.560
And the kind of work we do is...

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:23.430
Plug!

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.640
Here!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:28.520
You... explain the kind of work we're doing here!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.650
Understood!

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:32.230
With humans from the parallel world as our targets...

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:36.240
...we give those whose depression levels are significantly higher an electrical charge...

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.950
...to stimulate the recovery of their souls.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.330
Yes, that's exactly what we do.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:44.410
If only you knew that from the start!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.710
Not only have you destroyed your suit and wasted a ludicrous amount of electricity...

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.670
But you even destroyed your equipment as well!

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.550
I'll be taking that out of your salary.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.670
Please Captain Pulse, have a heart!

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:59.220
I recently bought a ton of stuff!

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:02.640
I'm having a bad month...
Aren't you being too harsh?!

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.890
If that's the case, go fix your screwup.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:08.390
But my pay is awful!

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:12.940
Then how about you follow orders and shape up?!

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:16.950
You're on overtime! Get your ass moving!

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:17.740
Understood!

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.660
<i>But I'm already working as hard as I can...</i>

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.710
Plug In!

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:30.710
Plug In!

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:39.680
What the?

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:41.640
What's wrong?

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.720
It felt like I bumped into something.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.600
Wonder what it was...

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:49.600
That's weird.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:53.020
Stealth device: activated.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.610
Though humans can't see us, they can touch us.

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:59.530
To be on the safe side, I'll activate full-body stealth.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:07.290
Well then, let's get to work!

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:27.720
Just my luck, not a target in sight...

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.770
Even though our service is clearly beneficial to humans in this parallel world...

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:36.690
This is a huge problem for my purse!

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:38.900
I have to look for a target, quickly!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.700
Thank you for your patronage!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.910
Thank you for your patronage!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.000
Sentou, please go help out in the back.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.380
But I'm in charge of greeting customers today.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:18.570
Figures, I can't find any targets in this family restaurant...

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.950
I wonder where they are...

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.500
He got it.

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.000
What the heck are you doing?!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.840
That's supposed to be my line!

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.840
What in the world are you? Who are you?!

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:49.180
Could it be that you can see me?

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.430
Obviously I can see you if I just hit you.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:52.810
Who exactly are you?

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.480
A family restaurant burglar?

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:57.650
What's going on, brother?

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.770
Hakone, Iono.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.530
What happened? And what's with the baseball bat...

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:07.740
I'm not sure what kind of an employee uses his free time to swing a bat around.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.370
Who's swinging a bat?

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:10.830
You guys can't see this person?

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:13.750
This person?

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.250
What is he talking about?

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.750
<i>So there's nothing wrong with the stealth device.</i>

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.800
<i>Then, why can this guy see me?</i>

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.380
What are you looking at?!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.840
Hey, what're you talking about?

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.850
Senny, are you overworked?

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.310
Don't look at me like that.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.100
Brother, you'll be done with work soon, right?

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:36.350
My bad.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.690
It suddenly became a night shift today.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:43.570
Is that so? Then we can't go home together, I guess.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:47.030
And I thought it would be a great chance to give...

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:48.780
Give what?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.950
It's nothing, nothing at all!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:58.290
Then I'll make dinner for you tonight!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:01.040
What do you want to eat, brother?

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.800
It's okay, there's no need for you to do that.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.720
Once I'm done with work, I'll go home quickly.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.560
You don't have to worry about me.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:15.270
But...

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:17.890
Depression level C!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.900
A target that needs to be charged!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.190
What a kind brother.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.570
Not the best place to find one...

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:36.450
I'm going to fully charge you!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.040
Fight!

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.420
In one strike!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.420
What were you going to do to Hakone?!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.220
What are you doing?

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.520
This is my job.

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.520
My name is Plug.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.520
Let's talk about what you do, first.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.190
Since Hakone's life energy is low...

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:11.240
...you want to stick that ridiculously large plug into her?

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:12.160
Yes!

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.030
It's to charge her up!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:17.250
People call us the Charging Ladies!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.080
That's all you have to say?

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:22.750
Why?!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.090
Shut up!

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:26.710
Why would I let you play around
with huge amounts of electricity?

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.590
Besides, in what way does Hakone not look well?

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:34.930
Well, the life checker marked
Hakone's depression level as C.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.350
Depression level?

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:40.230
Yes. Even though it's only at C...

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:44.810
If it goes on like this, the situation will become more dire!

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:49.990
At high depression levels, life energy continues to drop...

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:52.410
...and humans will become unmotivated, tired...

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:55.450
...and in the end, their hearts will be damaged.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.950
If that happens, the person will become useless, crippled...

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.540
...and might even go as far as committing suicide.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:01.920
Suicide?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.380
That's impossible...

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:08.050
My mom died several years ago...

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:11.970
...and dad only cares about working,
so the family is a little lonely...

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:17.260
That's why I don't want Hakone to feel hurt.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.140
How is it? It hurts, doesn't it?

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:27.730
Well, Magical Girl Sweety Milly?

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:31.490
Do you still think you can bring love to the whole world?

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:35.030
I will never admit defeat!

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:48.420
Isn't this the show that caused
a lot of controversy, "Sweety Milly"?

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:54.430
I must be very lucky to be able to
watch this kind of love-filled anime!

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:57.640
No, you're unlucky.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:04.810
Give up, Milly.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.730
You should have known that love is useless!

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:13.400
Get your slimy hands off my bitch!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.990
I won't let you charge her.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:31.250
Sorry, Hakone.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.510
I took my time changing.

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:36.970
I'll make dinner right now.

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:38.970
Brother!

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:41.810
You don't have to do anything.

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:43.470
Just wait a little longer.

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:56.860
Hakone...

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.790
Brother!

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:14.630
You run too fast!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.220
You're slow, idiot!

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.720
Even though Sentou said he won't allow me to charge her...

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:23.970
<i>Why would I let you play around with huge amounts of electricity?</i>

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:26.850
<i>Besides, in what way does Hakone not look well?</i>

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:29.940
How rude!

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:32.230
What does he mean, "play around?!"

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:35.240
We charge people for the sake of making everybody happy!

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:36.740
Good morning, Hakone!

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:38.400
Good morning.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:39.570
Good morning!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.160
Good morning.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:45.580
But... it is still very troublesome.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:50.380
Just what is causing her depression?

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:53.960
This is Hakone's school!

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.920
Speaking of that time...

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.220
Then, start reading from the right of page 23.

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:21.910
See you tomorrow, Hakone.

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:23.530
Bye-bye.

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.830
I have absolutely no idea why she's depressed...

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:53.650
I'm home!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.150
I have to go to work tonight.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.150
I might be home late.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.150
Be sure to eat dinner.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.150
Sentou

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:06.240
Sentou did everything by himself?

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.700
Even the miso soup is done.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.750
He's like a super chef!

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:17.670
Hakone?

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:31.640
Mom...

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:36.980
<i>Hakone.</i>

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.320
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:44.320
<i>Brother...</i>

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:48.330
<i>Just leave it to me. You don't have to worry about anything.</i>

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:51.000
<i>Brother!</i>

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.920
<i>Hakone.</i>

00:14:58.090 --> 00:14:59.550
Mom...

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:05.640
Even without you, even if dad is busy working...

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:08.050
I don't feel lonely at all.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.220
But...

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:13.350
Brother is always pushing himself for my sake...

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.070
If he gets sick...

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:22.070
...and ends up like you, Mom...

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:26.110
The thought of it... is killing me...

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:31.950
Hakone... so you're worried about Sentou...

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:39.380
So it was this guy's fault after all!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:49.140
<i>Even though it's only a C...</i>

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:53.930
<i>If it goes on like this, the situation will become more dire!</i>

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.770
Hakone...

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:56.730
Hey...

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:08.110
Pardon the ruckus!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.490
I'll be going on ahead.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.330
Nice job today!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:21.170
Sentou, even though this isn't part of my job...

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:22.880
I would like to speak with you for a moment.

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:26.720
Only for a minute.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.850
So because of that, Hakone is...

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:40.310
Hakone must be in pain...

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:43.070
Don't kid around.

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:48.660
I didn't hurt Hakone.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:50.780
I'm only protecting her.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:55.750
Hakone doesn't have to worry about me.
She just has to grow up well.

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:56.830
That's not it!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.460
The fact that you're working hard on your own...

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:02.340
That's what's making Hakone feel like she's incapable of doing anything!

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:03.710
Hakone...

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:04.880
Wait a second.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:08.380
You heard everything you just said in the bathroom, right?

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.130
Yeah.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:12.930
That means you must have peeked at Hakone bathing!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:14.600
No! Listen to me!

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:16.890
Now is not the time to bring that up!

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.270
Batter up!

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.020
Home run!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.490
I'm home!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:30.660
Hakone?

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:34.160
In her room?

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:36.790
Hey, Hakone!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:41.540
Brother, I've gone

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:41.540
to see mom.

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.540
"I've gone to see mom."

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.580
What?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.420
She said she's going to see her mom.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:46.800
Don't tell me...

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:49.010
She's going to commit suicide?

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.810
Is Hakone here?

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:01.270
Yes!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:09.150
Thank goodness, there's a transformer nearby.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.360
A transformer?

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:14.370
In order to charge up a person's soul,
large amounts of electricity are needed.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:18.200
An electric pole's power supply is usually enough.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:22.580
Alright!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:26.630
Now we're free to use as much electricity as we need.

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:28.800
Anyway, I'll change into my work suit first.

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:29.590
Suit?

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.390
What sort of outfit is that?!

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.730
My field uniform, I guess?

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.520
Something that would make perverts happy, huh?

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:48.190
Are there rubber suit freaks?

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:55.870
Before transformation

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:54.820
In emergencies, Charging Ladies will transform into their charging suit within 0.01 seconds.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.870
After transformation

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.740
Duration: 0.01 second

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:58.450
Then, let's slowly watch this transformation process.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.790
We'll talk about this later since we don't have enough time!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:06.880
Hakone!

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:13.010
I have to do what I can with my power.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:16.260
Hakone!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.680
Plug setup complete!

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:21.720
The ground wire.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:24.980
As a precaution, I have to attach the ground wire properly.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:29.440
I can't mess up this time...

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:34.280
I have to rescue Sentou's beloved sister!

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.490
Mom...

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:38.740
Hakone!

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.160
Brothe-

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.920
No!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:56.430
Brother!

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:57.590
Are you alright?

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.680
I'm pulling you up now!

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.970
Brother...

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:07.980
Damn, this is bad...

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:11.690
Brother, let go! At this rate, you'll fall too...

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.940
I won't let go! You're my beloved little sister!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:17.360
Brother...

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:20.910
Charge!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.840
Let's go, brother.

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:43.560
Hey, what are you doing? Hakone!

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:46.850
Hey! That's dangerous!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:01.530
Are you alright, Hakone?

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:02.700
Yeah.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:09.960
Brother.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:11.130
Yes?

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.750
You're always working hard for my sake.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:17.090
It makes me very happy and I'm thankful for that.

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:20.470
Well, obviously, that's what an older brother is-

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:23.050
But, you know, please stop doing that.

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:26.430
I want to help out, too!

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.310
I also want to work hard for you!

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.850
Hakone, but...

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:32.440
Hakone?

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.480
I like you a lot!

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:37.570
That's why, even if it's housework or something else...

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:39.990
I want to do it with you, brother!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.070
Hakone...

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:45.580
Really...

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:47.370
I'm such an idiot.

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:49.790
A stupid brother.

00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:50.750
Brother...

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.840
From now on, let's take turns making dinner.

00:21:57.510 --> 00:21:58.460
Sure!

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:05.760
I'm happy for you, Hakone.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:14.440
I'm off!

00:22:14.440 --> 00:22:16.820
See you, brother!

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:20.700
Yeah! Don't forget you're making dinner tonight!

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:21.950
Sure!

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:24.620
Hakone, did something good happen?

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:25.990
Not really.

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:28.290
That's even more suspicious.

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:31.160
Come on, spit it out already!

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:33.170
Wait! Tell me everything!

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:35.750
This is all thanks to her.

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:38.760
Thank you, Plug.

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:43.380
What's with this whole "this report is late, Plug!" thing?

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:46.890
The captain didn't have to put it that way...

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:51.140
Are Sentou and the rest doing well after that?

00:22:57.980 --> 00:22:59.730
Hello!

00:23:01.490 --> 00:23:02.700
You little...

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.000
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.000
Miracles are right beside reality

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:16.080
Kanarazu aru

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:16.080
They're there for sure

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:27.430
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:27.430
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:33.350
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:33.350
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:39.270
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:39.270
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:45.490
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:45.490
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:46.870
Hitori janai

00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:46.870
You're not alone

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:53.160
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:53.160
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:59.090
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:59.090
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:23:59.460 --> 00:24:05.050
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:23:59.460 --> 00:24:05.050
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:11.010
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:11.010
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:16.900
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:16.900
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:24:17.190 --> 00:24:24.650
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:24:17.190 --> 00:24:24.650
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:24:48.380 --> 00:24:50.600
Plug

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:52.720
What is she doing?

00:24:55.350 --> 00:24:58.020
Fight In one Strike!! Charging Ladies!! finally starts!

00:24:58.020 --> 00:25:00.610
With that said, I'm eager to be the main character!

00:25:00.610 --> 00:25:05.360
Well, since I'm a Neodym Inc. elite,
I think I should be the only main character...

00:25:05.360 --> 00:25:07.950
Hey, who says you get to call the shots?!

00:25:07.950 --> 00:25:09.070
I'm the main character!

00:25:09.070 --> 00:25:12.120
Plug Cryostat!

00:25:12.120 --> 00:25:14.120
You've got guts to put yourself on the same level as me...

00:25:14.990 --> 00:25:17.460
You really piss me off!

00:25:17.460 --> 00:25:19.790
On the next episode of
Fight In one Strike! Charging Ladies!!:

00:25:19.210 --> 00:25:24.630
Timing!

00:25:19.790 --> 00:25:21.080
Timing!

00:25:21.080 --> 00:25:22.500
By the way, who are you?

00:25:22.500 --> 00:25:24.880
You'll have to find out in the next episode.
